
== formatters: bytes
0 -> 0 B
999 -> 999 B
1000 -> 1000 B
1500 -> 1.5 KiB
999999 -> 976.6 KiB
223200000 -> 212.9 MiB
1070000000 -> 1020.4 MiB
12800000000 -> 11.9 GiB
2500000000000 -> 2.3 TiB

== formatters: duration
0 -> undefined
45 -> undefined
60 -> 1m
90 -> 1m
3600 -> 1h
8000 -> 2h 13m
86400 -> 1d
90000 -> 1d 1h
180000 -> 2d 2h
-1 -> undefined
nan -> undefined
1e+13 -> undefined

== formatters: time left
100 at 10/s -> under a minute left
9000 at 10/s -> 15m left
1 at 1000/s -> under a minute left

== formatters: ellipsis
9 bytes -> "short.txt" (valid UTF-8: true)
64 bytes -> "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" (valid UTF-8: true)
65 bytes -> "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\226\128\166" (valid UTF-8: true)
69 bytes -> "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\226\128\166" (valid UTF-8: true)
81 bytes -> "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\226\128\166" (valid UTF-8: true)
81 bytes -> "aaaaaaaaaa bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb\226\128\166" (valid UTF-8: true)
100 bytes -> "Compte rendu de la r\195\169union g\195\169n\195\169rale extraordinaire du\226\128\166" (valid UTF-8: true)

== formatters: file icon
a.JPG -> image-x-generic
a.dng -> image-x-generic
a.mkv -> video-x-generic
a.opus -> audio-x-generic
a.csv -> x-office-spreadsheet
a.odp -> x-office-presentation
a.epub -> x-office-document
a.tar.zst -> package-x-generic
a.txt -> text-x-generic
Makefile -> text-x-generic
.pdf -> text-x-generic

